# SRT.Core.Swaggers (Cursor rule template)

Copy to `.cursor/rules/SRT.Core.Swaggers.CURSOR_RULE.mdc`.

Follow `docs/SRT.Core.Swaggers.AI_RULES.md`.

- Do not register Swagger in `Program.cs`
- `IHasSwaggerConfig` + non-null `SwaggerConfig` requests this plugin
- Production hides UI unless `SwaggerInProduction`
- `RoutePrefix` true (default) uses default swagger path; false → UI at `/`
